      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹10.73 (up from ₹10.62 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹10.3b (down 12% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.07b (up 1.4% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 20% (up from 17% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 6.5%. Earnings per share (EPS) exceeded analyst estimates by 5.9%. Revenue is forecast to grow 15% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 8.3% growth forecast for the Entertainment industry in Asia. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 3% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 9% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
